                    Design: I will add simple test‐time                         
                    augmentation (TTA) by averaging model                       
                    outputs on each image and its                               
                    horizontal flip both during validation                      
                    and in the `predict` function. This                         
                    requires minimal changes—after                              
                    obtaining logits for the original                           
                    batch, I also compute logits on the                         
                    horizontally flipped batch, average the                     
                    two, then apply sigmoid to get                              
